# 项目框架总览

## Summary

This LMD document is a full-project overview for the current LTHS_MD / LMD_EDITER workspace. It is intentionally large and cross-cutting so the file itself can verify the LMD protocol, the canvas editor, the plugin strategy, the Mermaid flowchart boundary, and the practical readability of a single-file production document.

